00:00:05.156 --> 00:00:06.530
LILIANA YU: Google
Cloud Launcher

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:10.190
offers ready-to-go development
stack solutions and services

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.990
to accelerate development.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.300
It provides an easy
and fast way to get up

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.160
and running on
Google Cloud Platform

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.940
with common databases, operating
systems, and web frameworks.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.970
So you spend less
time installing

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.950
and more time developing.

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.690
In this Qwiklab, you'll learn
how Google Cloud Launcher lets

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.570
you quickly deploy functional
software packages that

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:31.790
run on Google Cloud Platform.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.710
Even if you're
unfamiliar with services

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:36.210
like Compute Engine
or Cloud Storage,

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:38.960
you can easily start up a
familiar software package

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.580
without having to
manually configure

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:43.730
the software, virtual
machine instances, storage,

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:45.200
or network settings.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:48.050
In this lab, Qwiklabs will
provide all the resources

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.830
you need to launch a common web
stack with the Cloud Launcher

00:00:51.830 --> 00:00:53.840
and verify your deployment.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:56.020
You'll be deploying
an Nginx stack.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.710
But after taking
this lab, you'll

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:59.330
be able to apply
what you've learned

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:01.340
in your own applications.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.900
On the Cloud
Launcher website, you

00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:06.540
can browse what software you can
begin working with right away.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:09.920
This is the fourth lab in
the GCP Essentials Quest.

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.760
A quest is a series of related
labs that form a learning path.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:16.130
Completing this quest
earns you this badge

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.410
to recognize your achievement.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.230
Next up, learn how to
create a persistent disk.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:24.880
